OL,3,ATech giant Nvidia to investigate CEO's
OL,4,Aaffair with suspected Chinese spy
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS tech giant Nvidia opens an
OL,7,Findependent investigation into claims
OL,8,Fits CEO Jensen Huang had an affair with
OL,9,Fa Chinese spy
OL,11,FIn a statement on Sunday, Huang
OL,12,Fadmitted to being unfaithful to his
OL,13,Fwife: "There is no excuse for what I
OL,14,Fdid"
OL,16,FNvidia - one of the most valuable firms
OL,17,Fin the world - says the investigation
OL,18,Fwill look at reports that Huang was
OL,19,F"the target of a foreign intelligence
OL,20,Feffort"
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,107,105,200,300,0,100
