OL,3,ATech giant Nvidia to investigate CEO's
OL,4,Aaffair with suspected Chinese spy
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe firm says it has no reason to
OL,7,Fbelieve Nvidia's secrets or national
OL,8,Fsecurity were compromised, but it will
OL,9,F"examine all available information" -
OL,10,FDonald Trump says Huang is "a fine
OL,11,Fperson, but you never know what's going
OL,12,Fon"
OL,14,FThe New York Times first reported last
OL,15,Fmonth that Jensen Huang had a close
OL,16,Frelationship with Alice Huang, a boss
OL,17,Fat a Singapore-based data centre
OL,18,Fcompany - and that she was suspected of
OL,19,Fgiving information to China
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
